      ":question/id": "b208f6c6-46ed-5eb4-acad-dab019616724",
      ":question/difficulty": ":question.difficulty/moderate",
      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the **exact** value.\n\n$$\n1-2\\sin^2\\left(15^\\circ\\right)\n$$",
      ":question/worked-solution": "Use the cosine double-angle identity:\n\n$$\n1-2\\sin^2\\left(x\\right)=\\cos(2x)\n$$\n\nSubstitute the angle and evaluate the standard-angle cosine:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\n&1-2\\sin^2\\left(15^\\circ\\right) \\\\\n&= \\cos\\left(2\\cdot 15^\\circ\\right) \\\\\n&= \\cos\\left(30^\\circ\\right) \\\\\n&= \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}\n\\end{aligned}\n$$",
